me at number two.

00:34:48.519 --> 00:34:50.021
They didn't put me on at all.

00:34:50.021 --> 00:34:53.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
So the stats are not as
honest as basketball stats

00:34:53.791 --> 00:34:55.693
