the New York Times.

00:34:55.693 --> 00:34:56.794
- I've definitely heard that.

00:34:56.794 --> 00:34:58.029
And so we just,

00:34:58.029 --> 00:35:00.131 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm just, my hands are
up and just saying,

00:35:00.131 --> 00:35:01.065
