00:35:01.065 --> 00:35:01.999
If it happens, it happened.

00:35:01.999 --> 00:35:03.201
If it doesn't, it doesn't.

00:35:03.201 --> 00:35:04.802
I'm excited either
way about the turnout

00:35:04.802 --> 00:35:06.737 align:start size:97% position:3%
and you know what everybody's
saying about the book.

00:35:06.737 --> 00:35:07.939
- New York times, basically,

00:35:07.939 --> 00:35:09.841 align:start size:81% position:19%
you could have
36, 12, and eight.

00:35:09.841 --> 00:35:12.076 align:start size:84% position:16%
And they'll say you
had 12, four, and two.

00:35:12.076 --> 00:35:13.478
That's how it works, so.

00:35:13.478 --> 00:35:15.246
(Both chuckles)

00:35:15.246 --> 00:35:16.347
- I got you, I understand.

00:35:16.347 --> 00:35:17.982
- Jonathan, you're awesome, man.

00:35:17.982 --> 00:35:19.350
I hope to see you soon.

00:35:19.350 --> 00:35:20.785
And I told you,

00:35:20.785 --> 00:35:22.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got a pretty sweet
court down here in Miami.

00:35:22.253 --> 00:35:24.355
So in that knees feeling good,

00:35:24.355 --> 00:35:26.124
I think here's my prediction.

00:35:26.124 --> 00:35:28.159 align:start size:84% position:16%
We're gonna play
horse at some point.

00:35:28.159 --> 00:35:31.095
I think I can get an S on ya.

00:35:31.095 --> 00:35:32.930
I think I can get
it as far to an S.

00:35:32.930 --> 00:35:36.200
I can still shoot.

00:35:36.200 --> 00:35:38.136
- Oh, wow, an S?

00:35:38.136 --> 00:35:39.370
(Jonathan chuckles)

00:35:39.370 --> 00:35:40.705
Okay, now, okay.

00:35:40.705 --> 00:35:42.573 align:start size:84% position:16%
We definitely gotta
figure this thing out.

00:35:42.573 --> 00:35:44.142 align:start size:81% position:19%
So when we play
Miami next season,

00:35:44.142 --> 00:35:45.343
we'll figure it out.

00:35:45.343 --> 00:35:46.410
- All right.

00:35:46.410 --> 00:35:47.345
We're gonna make it happen.

00:35:47.345 --> 00:35:48.613
It was great seeing you, man.

